# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HisabKitab environment variables (ALL OPTIONAL)
# The app works WITHOUT this file — you can paste your Google
# OAuth Client ID inside the app on the "One-time Setup" page.
# But if you prefer, set it here and it will be used automatically.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Google OAuth Client ID (Web application) — how to create:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Enable "Google Drive API" first, then create OAuth Client ID.
# Add your site URL (e.g. https://yourname.github.io/hisabkitab/)
# to "Authorized JavaScript origins".
VITE_GCLIENT_ID=
